<text><p><p>4. 
	    
	Apart from normal seasonal variation, how has demand for C&amp;I
	loans changed over the past three months? (Please consider
	only funds actually disbursed as opposed to requests for new or increased
	lines of credit.)
      </p></p></text>
<ul><p>A. 
